@page "/"

<PageTitle>Smart-X Gateway</PageTitle>

<div class="landing">
    <h1>Smart-X IoT Mesh Gateway</h1>
    <p class="lead">
        Central console for the Smart-X ecosystem: ingest telemetry from simulated
        ESP32-style nodes, issue live override commands, and (in the final PoE) visualise the mesh
        network these nodes hop across.
    </p>

    <div class="pillar-grid">
        <a class="pillar-card active" href="telemetry">
            <div class="pillar-icon">📡</div>
            <h2>Sensor Data Ingestion &amp; Telemetry</h2>
            <p>Register sensors, validate their deployment location, attach configs/logs, and watch live telemetry.</p>
            <span class="pillar-status pillar-status-active">Open</span>
        </a>

        <a class="pillar-card active" href="command-stream">
            <div class="pillar-icon">⚡</div>
            <h2>Real-Time Command Stream &amp; History</h2>
            <p>Priority-queued alerts, manual overrides with undo, and predictive action suggestions.</p>
            <span class="pillar-status pillar-status-active">Open</span>
        </a>

        <div class="pillar-card disabled">
            <div class="pillar-icon">🕸️</div>
            <h2>Network Topology &amp; Mesh Routing</h2>
            <p>Graph the physical mesh, traverse it, and compute the most power-efficient routing tree.</p>
            <span class="pillar-status">Final PoE</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<style>
    .landing {
        max-width: 900px;
    }

    .lead {
        color: #5a6270;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .pillar-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
        gap: 1.25rem;
    }

    .pillar-card {
        display: block;
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 1.5rem;
        border: 1px solid #e2e5ea;
        background: #fff;
        text-decoration: none;
        color: inherit;
        transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
    }

    .pillar-card.active:hover {
        transform: translateY(-3px);
        box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(20, 30, 60, 0.08);
        border-color: #6a5acd;
    }

    .pillar-card.disabled {
        background: #f5f6f8;
        color: #9aa1ab;
        cursor: not-allowed;
    }

    .pillar-icon {
        font-size: 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .pillar-card h2 {
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    }

    .pillar-card p {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        margin: 0 0 1rem;
    }

    .pillar-status {
        display: inline-block;
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: #eceef2;
        color: #6b7280;
    }

    .pillar-status-active {
        background: #e6f4ea;
        color: #1e7b34;
    }
</style>
